# Membership summary

The notice period for members is forty-five (45) days, counted from the day the written notice is received [[cite:obs-694fe8128e995061b8e1987ce00b1b8b00f37a52 "Members may terminate their membership in writing. The notice period for members is forty-five (45) days, counted from the day the written notice is received."]].

The expense approval threshold is 500 EUR per single expense [[cite:obs-888bf91de1f22c2b45ea92efb42dd78339816d20 "With effect from 1 October 2026 the expense approval threshold is 500 EUR per single expense."]].
